{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"新能源制造业","country":"马来西亚","country_iso":"MYS","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:27:02.198767","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MYS-MF-0009","ldc":"No","location":"吉打州","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"马来西亚吉打州居林市亿纬动力电池生产项目","project_name_en":"EVE Energy Malaysia Phase 1 Project (Kedah, Malaysia)","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中建安装","content":"2025年日本大阪世博会\n中国馆钢结构项目\n项目位于日本大阪，占地面积约3500平方米，建设内容包含钢结构材料采购、制作、预组装、运输等内容。项目是大阪·关西世博会最大的外国自建馆之一，建成后将以文化展示和活动为重点，进一步推动中国与世界各国的人文交流、民间友好和民心相通，促进文明在交流互鉴中共同前进。\n亿纬马来西亚一期总承包项目\n项目位于马来西亚吉打州居林市，总建筑面积约22.8万平方米，建设内容包含电芯车间、化成车间、甲类仓、办公楼、综合楼等23个单体及1个风雨连廊。项目建成投产后预计新增20吉瓦时储能动力电池产能，进一步推动区域能源转型升级，更好满足东南亚地区不断增长的动力电池市场需求，并为该地区可持续交通发展做出贡献。","content_sha256":"c5735dbda969532626d09958f9c6d73a76491d003c39dcb2d0216c1026cf1f57","id":9241,"publish_date":"2024-03-08 15:58:02","title":"中建安装承建的2025年日本大阪世博会中国馆钢结构项目、亿纬马来西亚一期总承包项目开工","title_sha256":"76b573c0e9418796b55791b0932ec7625304b958b4dcdb6d09cfdb5be2e78e08","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/61623.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MYS-MF-0009","capacity_details":"20 GWh","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"20000","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:27:02.199786","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MYS-MF-0009-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://inco.cscec.com/xwzx_new_41667/gsyw/202502/3855603.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"2024-03-01","production_capacity_unit":"GWh/年","production_capacity_value":20.0,"project_developer":"亿纬","project_developer_en":"EVE Energy","project_stage":"开工","project_summary":"中建安装承建了位于马来西亚吉